  "content": {
    "rendered": "<div class=\"atlas-purified-matrix\"><style>\n        .gradient-bg { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e3a8a 0%, #f59e0b 100%); }\n        .hero-section { min-height: 80vh; display: flex; align-items: center; }\n        .service-card { border-bottom: 4px solid #f59e0b; transition: 0.3s ease; }\n        .service-card:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); border-bottom: 4px solid #1e3a8a; }\n        b { color: #ea580c; }\n        .price-row:nth-child(even) { background-color: #fffbeb; }\n        .special-zone-section { background: linear-gradient(rgba(30, 58, 138, 0.95), rgba(30, 58, 138, 0.95)), url('https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/chiller-service-in-vadodara.webp'); background-size: cover; background-position: center; }\n    </style>\n\n\n    <!-- Hero Banner -->\n    <header class=\"hero-section gradient-bg text-white relative overflow-hidden\">\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-yellow-400 opacity-20 rounded-full -mr-20 -mt-20\"></div>\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 py-20 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center relative z-10\">\n            <div class=\"md:w-1/2 mb-10 md:mb-0\">\n                <span class=\"bg-yellow-400 text-blue-900 px-4 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-bold mb-4 inline-block\">Best Cooling Service in Diamond City</span>\n                <h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold leading-tight mb-6\">\n                    Professional <span class=\"text-yellow-300 underline\">AC Repair Surat</span> Center\n                </h1>\n                <p class=\"text-xl mb-8 leading-relaxed text-blue-50\">\n                    Premium <b>air conditioner repair</b> for residences, textile markets, and heavy industrial hubs across Surat. <b>Atlas Aircon</b> provides expert technical care for all major AC brands.\n                </p>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-4\">\n                    <a href=\"https://wa.me/919727257141\" class=\"bg-green-500 hover:bg-green-600 text-white font-bold py-4 px-8 rounded-full flex items-center shadow-lg transition duration-300\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n                        <svg class=\"w-6 h-6 mr-2\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M.057 24l1.687-6.163c-1.041-1.804-1.588-3.849-1.588-5.946 0-6.556 5.332-11.888 11.888-11.888 3.176 0 6.161 1.237 8.404 3.48s3.481 5.229 3.481 8.404c0 6.556-5.332 11.888-11.888 11.888-2.013 0-3.987-.512-5.735-1.483l-6.249 1.708zm6.303-4.463c1.554.92 3.402 1.403 5.284 1.403 5.614 0 10.185-4.571 10.185-10.185 0-2.719-1.059-5.277-2.983-7.201s-4.482-2.983-7.202-2.983c-5.614 0-10.185 4.571-10.185 10.185 0 1.957.561 3.864 1.623 5.513l-1.066 3.89 3.987-1.091z\"/></svg>\n                        WhatsApp Surat Team\n                    </a>\n                    <a href=\"/ac-repair-service-price-list-air-conditioner-repair-service-cost-in-vadodara-gujarat\" class=\"bg-yellow-400 text-blue-900 font-bold py-4 px-8 rounded-full shadow-lg hover:bg-yellow-500 transition duration-300\">\n                        View Price List\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"md:w-1/2 flex justify-center\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Atlas-aircon-vehicle.webp\" alt=\"Atlas Aircon AC Repair Surat Service Vehicle\" class=\"rounded-2xl shadow-2xl border-8 border-yellow-400 transform rotate-2\" title=\"\">\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Pros and Cons Section -->\n    <section class=\"py-16 bg-white\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-12 uppercase tracking-wide\">Why Choose <b>Atlas Aircon</b> for AC Repair in Surat</h2>\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10\">\n                <div class=\"bg-yellow-50 p-8 rounded-xl shadow-inner border-l-8 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6 flex items-center text-orange-700\">\n                        <svg class=\"w-6 h-6 mr-2 text-yellow-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"></path></svg>\n                        Surat Service Benefits\n                    </h3>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-4\">\n                        <li><b>Local reach</b> serving Adajan, Vesu, Varachha, and Katargam.</li>\n                        <li><b>Qualified technicians</b> specialized in industrial GIDC and textile market units.</li>\n                        <li>Use of <b>branded spare parts</b> to combat coastal salt air corrosion.</li>\n                        <li><b>Transparent billing</b> with competitive Surat market rates.</li>\n                        <li><b>Rapid response</b> for critical breakdown calls in Hazira and Sachin industrial belts.</li>\n                        <li><b>Expert troubleshooting</b> for high-load centralized and VRF systems.</li>\n                        <li><b>Verified warranty</b> on all PCB repairs and compressor replacements.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-orange-50 p-8 rounded-xl shadow-inner border-l-8 border-orange-500\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6 flex items-center text-blue-900\">\n                        <svg class=\"w-6 h-6 mr-2 text-orange-500\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z\"></path></svg>\n                        AC Risks in Surat\n                    </h3>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-4 text-gray-700\">\n                        <li>Salt air from Dumas leads to <b>rapid copper pipe corrosion</b>.</li>\n                        <li>Textile dust causes <b>severe indoor filter clogging</b>.</li>\n                        <li>High power demand leads to <b>frequent PCB circuit failures</b>.</li>\n                        <li>Duplicate components result in <b>unstable system performance</b>.</li>\n                        <li>Clogged blowers cause <b>unpleasant odors</b> and low airflow.</li>\n                        <li>Ignoring minor leaks leads to <b>expensive compressor burnouts</b>.</li>\n                        <li>Skipping service results in <b>sky-high industrial electricity bills</b>.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- SPECIAL SECTION: HAZIRA, SACHIN, DUMAS, KADODARA, NAVSARI -->\n    <section class=\"py-20 special-zone-section text-white relative\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10\">\n            <div class=\"bg-blue-900 bg-opacity-90 p-10 rounded-3xl border-2 border-yellow-400 shadow-2xl\">\n                <h2 class=\"text-4xl font-extrabold mb-8 text-yellow-400 uppercase text-center\">Exclusive AC Support: Surat Industrial &#038; Coastal Hubs</h2>\n                <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8\">\n                    <div class=\"bg-white bg-opacity-5 p-6 rounded-xl border border-blue-700\">\n                        <h4 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-3 text-orange-400\">Hazira Industrial Belt</h4>\n                        <p class=\"text-blue-100 text-sm\">Professional <b>chiller repair</b> and heavy-duty <b>hvac maintenance</b> for petrochemical and steel plants in Hazira.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bg-white bg-opacity-5 p-6 rounded-xl border border-blue-700\">\n                        <h4 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-3 text-orange-400\">Sachin GIDC Zone</h4>\n                        <p class=\"text-blue-100 text-sm\">Specialized <b>panel ac service</b> and centralized cooling for textile units and chemical factories in Sachin.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bg-white bg-opacity-5 p-6 rounded-xl border border-blue-700\">\n                        <h4 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-3 text-orange-400\">Dumas Coastal Area</h4>\n                        <p class=\"text-blue-100 text-sm\">Anti-corrosive treatments and <b>ac gas charging</b> with high-grade copper replacements for Dumas residences.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bg-white bg-opacity-5 p-6 rounded-xl border border-blue-700\">\n                        <h4 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-3 text-orange-400\">Kadodara Hub</h4>\n                        <p class=\"text-blue-100 text-sm\">Fast <b>split ac repair</b> for warehouses and residential complexes in the Kadodara transport and market hub.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bg-white bg-opacity-5 p-6 rounded-xl border border-blue-700 lg:col-span-2\">\n                        <h4 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-3 text-orange-400\">Navsari Satellite City</h4>\n                        <p class=\"text-blue-100 text-sm\">Expanding our <b>ac service center</b> reach to Navsari, providing premium residential cooling and maintenance solutions for families and hospitals.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mt-12 text-center\">\n                    <a href=\"https://wa.me/919727257141\" class=\"bg-yellow-400 text-blue-900 px-10 py-4 rounded-full font-bold hover:bg-yellow-500 transition shadow-lg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Schedule Emergency Visit Now</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Surat Product Section -->\n    <section class=\"py-16 bg-yellow-50\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-4 text-blue-900\">Which Types of Products We Repair</h2>\n            <p class=\"text-center text-gray-600 mb-12\">Total cooling maintenance for residential, commercial, and textile sectors in Surat.</p>\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6\">\n                <div class=\"service-card bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow hover:shadow-xl\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Window-ac-repair-service.webp\" alt=\"Window AC Repair Surat\" class=\"w-full h-40 object-cover rounded-lg mb-4\" title=\"\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\"><a href=\"/window-ac-service-surat\" class=\"text-orange-600\">Window AC Service</a></h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4\">Full <b>window ac repair</b> including gas refill and motor work.</p>\n                    <a href=\"/window-ac-service-surat\" class=\"text-blue-800 font-bold hover:underline\">Book in Surat</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"service-card bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow hover:shadow-xl\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/chiller-service-in-vadodara.webp\" alt=\"Chiller Repair Surat\" class=\"w-full h-40 object-cover rounded-lg mb-4\" title=\"\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\"><a href=\"/chiller-repair-services-surat\" class=\"text-orange-600\">Chiller Repair</a></h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4\">Industrial <b>chiller maintenance</b> for Surat manufacturing units.</p>\n                    <a href=\"/chiller-repair-services-surat\" class=\"text-blue-800 font-bold hover:underline\">Book in Surat</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"service-card bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow hover:shadow-xl\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/advance-panel-ac-repair-service.webp\" alt=\"Panel AC Repair Surat\" class=\"w-full h-40 object-cover rounded-lg mb-4\" title=\"\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\"><a href=\"/panel-ac-service-surat\" class=\"text-orange-600\">Panel AC Repair</a></h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4\">Crucial <b>panel ac service</b> for textile machinery controls.</p>\n                    <a href=\"/panel-ac-service-surat\" class=\"text-blue-800 font-bold hover:underline\">Book in Surat</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"service-card bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow hover:shadow-xl flex flex-col justify-center items-center text-center\">\n                    <svg class=\"w-16 h-16 text-yellow-500 mb-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10\"></path></svg>\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\"><a href=\"/split-ac-service-surat\" class=\"text-orange-600\">Split AC Service</a></h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4\">Fast <b>split ac repair</b> and refrigerant top-up services.</p>\n                    <a href=\"/split-ac-service-surat\" class=\"text-blue-800 font-bold hover:underline\">Book in Surat</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Brands Surat -->\n    <section class=\"py-16 bg-white\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-12 uppercase text-blue-900\">Multi-Brand AC Service Center Surat</h2>\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-6\">\n                <a href=\"/blue-star-ac-service-center-surat\" class=\"p-4 border-2 border-orange-100 rounded-lg text-center hover:bg-orange-500 hover:text-white transition group\"><b class=\"group-hover:text-white\">Blue Star</b></a>\n                <a href=\"/daikin-ac-service-center-surat\" class=\"p-4 border-2 border-orange-100 rounded-lg text-center hover:bg-orange-500 hover:text-white transition group\"><b class=\"group-hover:text-white\">Daikin</b></a>\n                <a href=\"/samsung-ac-service-center-surat\" class=\"p-4 border-2 border-orange-100 rounded-lg text-center hover:bg-orange-500 hover:text-white transition group\"><b class=\"group-hover:text-white\">Samsung</b></a>\n                <a href=\"/lg-ac-service-center-surat\" class=\"p-4 border-2 border-orange-100 rounded-lg text-center hover:bg-orange-500 hover:text-white transition group\"><b class=\"group-hover:text-white\">LG</b></a>\n                <a href=\"/voltas-ac-service-center-surat\" class=\"p-4 border-2 border-orange-100 rounded-lg text-center hover:bg-orange-500 hover:text-white transition group\"><b class=\"group-hover:text-white\">Voltas</b></a>\n                <a href=\"/carrier-ac-service-center-surat\" class=\"p-4 border-2 border-orange-100 rounded-lg text-center hover:bg-orange-500 hover:text-white transition group\"><b class=\"group-hover:text-white\">Carrier</b></a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Surat Price Table -->\n    <section class=\"py-16 bg-orange-50\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-12\">AC Repair Price List Surat</h2>\n            <div class=\"overflow-x-auto bg-white rounded-xl shadow-2xl border-t-8 border-orange-500\">\n                <table class=\"min-w-full leading-normal\">\n                    <thead>\n                        <tr class=\"bg-blue-900 text-yellow-400\">\n                            <th class=\"px-5 py-4 text-left font-bold uppercase tracking-wider\">Surat Service Detail</th>\n                            <th class=\"px-5 py-4 text-left font-bold uppercase tracking-wider\">Starting Rate</th>\n                            <th class=\"px-5 py-4 text-left font-bold uppercase tracking-wider\">Action</th>\n                        </tr>\n                    </thead>\n                    <tbody class=\"text-gray-700\">\n                        <tr class=\"price-row\">\n                            <td class=\"px-5 py-5 border-b border-gray-100 text-sm\"><b>Split AC Jet Wash (Surat)</b></td>\n                            <td class=\"px-5 py-5 border-b border-gray-100 text-sm font-bold\">₹599</td>\n                            <td class=\"px-5 py-5 border-b border-gray-100 text-sm\"><a href=\"/ac-repair-service-price-list-air-conditioner-repair-service-cost-in-vadodara-gujarat\" class=\"text-orange-600 underline font-bold\">Full List</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr class=\"price-row\">\n                            <td class=\"px-5 py-5 border-b border-gray-100 text-sm\"><b>Gas Refilling (Surat Areas)</b></td>\n                            <td class=\"px-5 py-5 border-b border-gray-100 text-sm font-bold\">₹2500</td>\n                            <td class=\"px-5 py-5 border-b border-gray-100 text-sm\"><a href=\"/ac-repair-service-price-list-air-conditioner-repair-service-cost-in-vadodara-gujarat\" class=\"text-orange-600 underline font-bold\">Full List</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr class=\"price-row\">\n                            <td class=\"px-5 py-5 border-b border-gray-100 text-sm\"><b>PCB Troubleshooting</b></td>\n                            <td class=\"px-5 py-5 border-b border-gray-100 text-sm font-bold\">₹1500</td>\n                            <td class=\"px-5 py-5 border-b border-gray-100 text-sm\"><a href=\"/ac-repair-service-price-list-air-conditioner-repair-service-cost-in-vadodara-gujarat\" class=\"text-orange-600 underline font-bold\">Full List</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-8 grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4\">\n                <a href=\"/remote/\" class=\"p-3 bg-white border-2 border-orange-500 rounded text-center font-bold hover:bg-orange-500 hover:text-white transition shadow-sm\">AC Remote</a>\n                <a href=\"/capacitor\" class=\"p-3 bg-white border-2 border-orange-500 rounded text-center font-bold hover:bg-orange-500 hover:text-white transition shadow-sm\">AC Capacitor</a>\n                <a href=\"/compressor\" class=\"p-3 bg-white border-2 border-orange-500 rounded text-center font-bold hover:bg-orange-500 hover:text-white transition shadow-sm\">Compressor Fix</a>\n                <a href=\"/indoor-motor\" class=\"p-3 bg-white border-2 border-orange-500 rounded text-center font-bold hover:bg-orange-500 hover:text-white transition shadow-sm\">Indoor Motor</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Surat Local Areas -->\n    <section class=\"py-16 bg-blue-900 text-white\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-12 uppercase text-yellow-400\">Areas We Serve in Surat City</h2>\n            <div class=\"mb-12\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6 border-b border-blue-700 pb-2\">Residential &#038; Textile Markets</h3>\n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-4 text-sm text-blue-200\">\n                    <span>Adajan</span> <span>Vesu</span> <span>Piplod</span> <span>Varachha</span> <span>Katargam</span> <span>City Light</span>\n                    <span>Pal</span> <span>Bhatar</span> <span>Udhna</span> <span>Rander</span> <span>Amroli</span> <span>Ghod Dod Road</span>\n                    <span>Ring Road Market</span> <span>Parle Point</span> <span>Majiwada</span> <span>Sarthana</span> <span>Uttran</span> <span>Punagam</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6 border-b border-blue-700 pb-2\">Surat Industrial Belts</h3>\n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 text-sm text-blue-200\">\n                    <span>Hazira Industrial Belt</span> <span>Sachin GIDC</span> <span>Pandesara GIDC</span> <span>Kadodara Industrial Zone</span>\n                    <span>Olpad Industrial</span> <span>Ichchhapor GIDC</span> <span>Laskana Industrial Area</span> <span>Pipodara GIDC</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Surat FAQs -->\n    <section class=\"py-16 bg-yellow-50\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 max-w-4xl\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-12 uppercase text-blue-900\">Surat Service FAQs</h2>\n            <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">How much does AC gas charging cost in Surat?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">The <b>ac gas charging price</b> in Surat ranges from ₹2500 to ₹4500, depending on the refrigerant type (R32, R410, or R22) and the unit capacity.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">Do you provide AC repair in Hazira and Sachin GIDC?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Yes, we have a specialized industrial team for <b>heavy-duty ac repair</b> and HVAC maintenance across Hazira and Sachin GIDC zones.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">How to protect AC coils from salt air in Dumas?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">We provide <b>anti-corrosive coating</b> services for AC coils in coastal areas like Dumas and Hazira to prevent frequent gas leaks.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">Which brands of AC do you repair in Surat?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">We offer <b>multi-brand ac repair</b> for all leading names including LG, Samsung, Daikin, Blue Star, Voltas, Hitachi, and Carrier.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">Do you offer repair for inverter PCB boards in Surat?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Yes, our expert technicians are trained in <b>inverter pcb repair</b>, ensuring board-level fixes to save you from expensive replacements.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">Can you fix central AC for textile markets?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Absolutely. <b>Atlas Aircon</b> provides specialized <b>chiller repair services</b> and centralized AC maintenance for Surat&#8217;s textile market complexes.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">How long does a standard AC service take in Surat?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">A thorough <b>ac jet wash service</b> usually takes between 45 to 90 minutes per unit to ensure complete dust and lint removal.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">Do you serve Navsari and Kadodara areas?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Yes, we provide <b>fast ac repair</b> across Navsari city and the Kadodara market hub for both residential and commercial clients.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">What is the warranty on spare parts in Surat?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">We offer a <b>service warranty</b> on labor and a standard manufacturer-backed duration warranty on all genuine <b>ac spare parts</b> replaced.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">How can I book an Atlas Aircon technician?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Booking is easy. Click the <b>WhatsApp button</b> on our banner or call our Surat service desk directly at <b>+91 97272 57141</b>.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Footer -->\n    <footer class=\"bg-blue-900 text-white py-12 border-t-4 border-yellow-400\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-12\">\n            <div>\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/cropped-AtlasAircon-Logo.png\" alt=\"Atlas Aircon Surat\" class=\"h-12 mb-6\" title=\"\">\n                <p class=\"text-yellow-100\">Professional <b>AC repair Surat</b> and industrial cooling experts. Reliable service in the heart of South Gujarat.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <h4 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-6 text-yellow-400\">Surat Helpline</h4>\n                <p class=\"mb-2\">Call: +91 97272 57141</p>\n                <p>Location: Surat/Navsari, Gujarat</p>\n            